# TypeScript

- Use `import type { Foo } from '...'` for type-only imports (`verbatimModuleSyntax`)
- Prefix unused args and vars with `_`
- No `any`; avoid non-null assertions unless there is no alternative
- `===` only; `== null` is allowed for nullish checks
- Always use curly braces on `if` / `for` / `while`
